","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTimeSeparator","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The time-separator type indicates how to display the arrangement between the beats and beat-type values in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time signature. The default value is none. The horizontal, diagonal, and vertical values represent horizontal,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"diagonal lower-left to upper-right, and vertical lines respectively. For these values, the beats and beat-type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values are arranged on either side of the separator line. The none value represents no separator with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"beats and beat-type arranged vertically. The adjacent value represents no separator with the beats and beat-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type arranged horizontally."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTimeSeparator"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTimeSeparator"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltimeseparator"}}}